### List all applications
GET http://localhost:5117/api/applications
Accept: application/json

### Create an application
POST http://localhost:5117/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Google",
  "jobTitle": "Software Engineer Intern",
  "applicationSource": "LinkedIn",
  "status": "Applied",
  "location": "Bangalore",
  "salaryRange": "12-15 LPA",
  "notes": "Applied through college referral",
  "followUpDate": "2026-09-01"
}

### Create a second one
POST http://localhost:5117/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Zoho",
  "jobTitle": "Backend Developer",
  "applicationSource": "Greenhouse",
  "status": "Saved"
}

### Filter by status
GET http://localhost:5117/api/applications?status=Applied
Accept: application/json

### Search by company or job title
GET http://localhost:5117/api/applications?search=goog
Accept: application/json

### Validation failure — empty company, bad status. Expect 400.
POST http://localhost:5117/api/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "",
  "jobTitle": "Test Role",
  "applicationSource": "LinkedIn",
  "status": "Definitely Not A Real Status"
}

### Register a document
POST http://localhost:5117/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "shubham_resume.pdf",
  "fileType": "application/pdf",
  "fileSize": 245678,
  "storageRef": "users/test-user-123/resume.pdf",
  "displayName": "Resume v2"
}

### List documents
GET http://localhost:5117/api/documents
Accept: application/json

### Rejected file type — expect 400
POST http://localhost:5117/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "photo.png",
  "fileType": "image/png",
  "fileSize": 1000,
  "storageRef": "users/test-user-123/photo.png"
}